{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:20 2026-09-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:20 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:20 2026-09-16 HKT</p><p>柴灣杏花邨一單位，今日（9月16日）晚上近8時發生命案，一名中年女子被發現倒斃單位，頸部有刀傷，警方接報到場後，拘捕一名男子。</p><p>警方調查後，將案改列「謀殺」。據了解，女死者姓黃53歲，被捕男子姓黃52歲，兩人為夫妻關係。</p><img alt=\"大廈保安嚴陣以待。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab64747c34c785fb362e649606814313/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_22_44_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為柴灣杏花邨一單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b5921a6373131c4cb8c7a272db2a058/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_22_44_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d9d8124012933ee976635e788a1d82b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_23_04_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c58aa68c89ea130bbc5367705d82fb6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_23_04_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dab2f4147089e67984f405f7427f5f99/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_23_04_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"死者遺體由仵工移送至殮房。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/873caffc27cc584ab22973430104629f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_19_49_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"探員到單位內進行調查。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/678cd1737e414579e4bf600a56b7ef8a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_16_50_17_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:17:08.687218+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}